  "name": "Moving Average",
  "description": "The moving average function code computes a moving average from n samples taken at a defined interval. The sample buffer fills with an input value at the end of each cycle. At every sample interval, the current input value replaces the oldest value in the buffer. At each sample interval, a new average is calculated.",
  "description_lines": [
    "The moving average function code computes a moving average",
    "from n samples taken at a defined interval. The sample buffer",
    "fills with an input value at the end of each cycle. At every sam-",
    "ple interval, the current input value replaces the oldest value",
    "in the buffer. At each sample interval, a new average is calcu-",
    "lated."
